# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# kinds.mkind - Swedish-pack kind-atom localization (Phase 8).
#
# Each line is "<canonical> <localized>". The canonical is the ontology leaf
# name (English convention - see LOJ1897_Scripts/Merlin/ontology/Concepts.mon);
# the localized is the Swedish surface form the realize layer emits when a
# [k <canonical>] atom is rendered. A kind without an entry falls back to
# the canonical hstr (so a missing translation is visible but not broken).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

